{"path":"experimental/fs/path/operator_slash","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::operator/(std::experimental::filesystem::path)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::</span>operator/<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::experimental::filesystem::path)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/operator_slash","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Concatenates two paths. Effectively returns path(lhs) /= rhs.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/filesystem\">&lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path operator<span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> path<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Concatenates two paths. Effectively returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path<span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> rhs</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> paths to concatenate\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The result of path concatenation.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-inline\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span></span></div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span> p1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"C:Users\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>C:<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span> / <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>Users<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span> == \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span> p2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"batman\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span> p3 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> p1 <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> p2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// inserts fs::path::preferred_separator, '\\' on Windows</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>C:<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span> / <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>Users<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span> / <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>batman<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span> == \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p3 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>\"C:\" / \"Users\" == \"C:Users\"\n\"C:\" / \"Users\" / \"batman\" == \"C:Users\\batman\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/append\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>append</span><span>operator/=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  appends elements to the path <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::operator/(std::experimental::filesystem::path)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Concatenates two paths. Effectively returns path(lhs) /= rhs."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The result of path concatenation."},{"label":"Exceptions"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"append, operator/=","note":"appends elements to the path"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":122,"codeBlockCount":2}
